+  - id: AC-002
+    text: "Invalid vehicle information is rejected with a clear validation error and NO endorsement is created."
+  - id: AC-003
+    text: "A customer cannot submit an endorsement against a policy they do not own - the attempt is blocked (403)."
+  - id: AC-004
